[00:00.00] 作词 : 尚雯婕
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 尚雯婕
[00:12.11]编曲：Red Triangle
[00:16.74]Close my eyes (闭上双眼)
[00:18.10]Spread my wings (展开翅膀)
[00:19.69]Feel my heart beat (感受自己的心跳)
[00:21.29]In the lights (在光晕中)
[00:23.17]Never so alive (我从未如此鲜活)
[00:25.96]Ready to fly (亟待翱翔)
[00:29.66]Come with me (来)
[00:31.17]Dance with me (与我共舞)
[00:32.66]Glide with me (一起越过)
[00:34.22]Glide through the night (每一个夜晚)
[00:37.43]Let go of fear (放下恐惧吧)
[02:24.04][01:45.06][00:40.40]Let me be unafraid ([01:45.06][00:40.40]让我无所畏惧)
[02:27.26][01:48.13][00:43.42]Let me stand up straight ([01:48.13][00:43.42]让我挺起胸膛)
[02:30.35][01:51.50][00:46.52]With the wind with the storm I go ([01:51.50][00:46.52]追随狂风暴雨前行)
[03:00.09][02:33.58][01:54.49][00:49.70]Fly up high to the open sky ([02:33.58][01:54.49][00:49.70]直冲云霄)
[02:36.91][01:58.00][00:53.33]I will find my way ([01:58.00][00:53.33]我会找到属于自己的路)
[02:40.17][02:01.37][00:56.38]To release and truly breathe ([02:01.37][00:56.38]释放能量 真正地呼吸)
[02:43.28][02:04.28][00:59.52]Push away the boundaries ([02:04.28][00:59.52]突破所有界限)
[02:46.59][02:07.60][01:02.77]Down the road down the streams I flow ([02:07.60][01:02.77]沿着山川河流)
[03:09.87][03:02.86][02:49.88][02:10.97][01:06.18]To be free and unafraid ([03:02.86][02:49.88][02:10.97][01:06.18]自由与勇敢)
[03:29.65][03:22.09][01:12.57]Be free and unafraid ([03:22.09][01:12.57]自由与勇敢)
[01:21.71]Close my eyes (闭上双眼)
[01:22.88]Spread my wings (展开翅膀)
[01:24.56]Feel my heart beat (感受自己的心跳)
[01:26.21]In the lights (在光晕中)
[01:27.95]Giving everything (这一次)
[01:31.33]I've got this time (毫无保留)
[01:33.96]Come with me (来)
[01:35.93]Dance with me (与我共舞)
[01:37.40]Glide with me (一起越过)
[01:39.06]Glide through the night (每一个夜晚)
